tion is technically reviewed against the implemented reports and accurately reflects the shipped behavior (fields shown, threshold configuration, export output).\n- Reclamation guidance is reviewed for safety and clearly states that reclamation is manual (no automated deletion).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-4 (P2): documentation explains the reports and safe reclamation steps.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29355,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83ab9b1484cafa91","agent_id":"ab937682b8c4c817c","session_id":"912108fb-652c-486d-bf9a-f0099a27506b","uuid":"65c03a4f-2669-443a-b9c6-92e89211142d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:46:21.749Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
